# A starts a game, and Start pauses and resumes it. The title screen
# changes every frame, so expect-same passes only on a paused game.
run 30
pad 0 connect
run 5
pad 0 press a
run 2
pad 0 release a
run 20
pad 0 press start
run 2
pad 0 release start
run 5
mark
run 30
expect-same
pad 0 press start
run 2
pad 0 release start
run 5
expect-changed
